  lines:
  - speakerIcon: {fileID: 0}
    text: Alert. Energy overload detected.
  - speakerIcon: {fileID: 0}
    text: "The main grid can\u2019t hold much longer."
  - speakerIcon: {fileID: 0}
    text: Some systems will shut down intermittently.
  - speakerIcon: {fileID: 0}
    text: The creatures will sense the weakness.
  - speakerIcon: {fileID: 0}
    text: "Venom Spire. Void Resonator. I\u2019ll adapt\u2014just like they did."
